    <h1>Editorial Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <h2>Our Purpose</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica exists to provide practical agricultural information, tools and research-based resources that help farmers and agribusiness readers make better-informed decisions.</p>
    <h2>Originality</h2>
    <p>We aim to publish original explanations, practical guides, calculations, analysis and editorial material. External research may be referenced, but we do not intentionally republish other publishers' articles as our own.</p>
    <h2>Research and Sources</h2>
    <p>Where a claim depends on external data, regulations, market information or scientific research, we aim to identify or link to useful primary or authoritative sources. Agricultural prices and other changing figures should be treated according to their stated date and source.</p>
    <h2>Practical Experience</h2>
    <p>Some GoOrganicAfrica content is informed by farming experience, field observations and practical experimentation. Practical experience is identified as such and should not be confused with independently verified scientific evidence.</p>
    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>We may update articles, calculators and data when new information, better sources, changed prices or user feedback makes an update appropriate. Where practical, material updates will be reflected by an updated date.</p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>If you find an important factual error, please contact us with the page URL, the statement concerned and supporting evidence. We review credible correction requests and may amend the page where appropriate.</p>
    <h2>AI-Assisted Content</h2>
    <p>Technology, including AI-assisted tools, may be used in parts of our research, drafting, translation or production workflow. Human review remains responsible for the published material, and we aim to verify important factual and agricultural claims before publication.</p>
    <h2>Commercial Content</h2>
    <p>Paid products, commercial relationships, affiliate links or sponsored material will be identified where applicable. Commercial relationships do not change our obligation to provide useful and accurate information.</p>
    <h2>Contact the Editorial Team</h2>
    <p>Send corrections or editorial feedback to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
